{"results":[{"url":"https://x.com/kunalkamra88/status/1904222690803876139?lang=en","final_url":"https://x.com/kunalkamra88/status/1904222690803876139?lang=en","title":"Kunal Kamra (@kunalkamra88) on X","description":"My Statement -","language":"en","text":"You cheered on MVA govt’s vindictive demolition of Kangana Ranaut’s bungalow in 2020. The Bombay HC itself called out the BMC’s actions as a “sinister attempt to silence” her, yet you were busy mocking her, celebrating the same state overreach you now decry.\nAnd let’s not forget","author":"https://x.com/kunalkamra88","published_date":"2025-03-24T17:24:02.000Z","latency_ms":701.6424370012828,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}